    <string name="ui_preservation_title_eng">Preserving the Bulos Language</string>
    <string name="ui_preservation_support_eng">Supporting continued use, accessibility, and preservation.</string>
    <string name="ui_preservation_paragraph_one_eng">Bulos is an Indigenous language spoken by members of the Dumagat community. Like many Indigenous languages, it faces challenges in being passed on and used across generations.</string>
    <string name="ui_preservation_paragraph_two_eng">The Bulos Translator was created as an effort to support the preservation and continued use of the language through accessible digital technology.</string>
    <string name="ui_preservation_paragraph_three_eng">By helping users translate and interact with Bulos, Filipino, and English, this application aims to make the language more accessible while supporting ongoing documentation and preservation efforts.</string>
    <string name="ui_preservation_final_message_eng">Every word carries culture, identity, and history. Preserving a language also helps preserve the stories and knowledge of the community that speaks it.</string>
